  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How's life treating you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can you recommend a good movie for a ten year old who loves animals?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.25,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "An animated adventure about a lost dog or a fox trying to get home would be perfect. Funny, warm and not too scary.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.42,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She cries at sad endings though.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then skip the classic animal dramas. Lots of them have a heartbreaking twist.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.63,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What about nature documentaries? She might",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "actually like those more.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.51,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Great idea. Ocean and jungle series are gorgeous and full of amazing facts. Just skip the predator scenes if she's sensitive.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ha, yes, the cheetah ones were a disaster last time.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.22,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "movies.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then go for something about whales or baby animals. Much gentler.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
